折声 (zhesheng)
https://github.com/SensAlly-Agent/zhesheng

折声 is a modified version of eg2-transcribe by john-rocky
(https://github.com/john-rocky/eg2-transcribe, commit e6b7d5df02fcfe940c194d00ad5d055f958b9c6c),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE). eg2-transcribe's ios/ folder is this
repository's source/ios/; its android/ and reader/ folders are not included.


Changes (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))

折声 changes eg2-transcribe into a Mac app for Mandarin: the zh-v4 Mandarin reader with a character
language model (CTC prefix beam search with shallow fusion), the model bundled in the app, recording with
a confirmation before clearing, proofreading through AI websites (copy out, paste back), an editable
transcript, a new interface in Chinese, and tests. The Mandarin and language-model changes started from
the patch of eg2-transcribe in the eg2zh v4 model package, offered under the Apache License 2.0.

