Models

The models are not in this repository. They are inside the app and in the model pack of the releases
(zhesheng-model-v4.zip, unzipped into models/).

- Mandarin reader zh-v4 (eg2_reader_zh_fp16_T750.aimodel, vocab.txt, reader_config.json) and the
  character language model lm_zh_char.eg2lm: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
  (CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). The training data, its creators and
  the attributions are in source/ios/Resources/Licenses/: NOTICE.md, DATA_LICENSES.json, LM_NOTICE.md
  and YODAS_VIDEOS.tsv. Keep these files with the reader and the language model.

- EmbeddingGemma 2 audio encoder (eg2_audio_fp16_T3000.aimodel), pipeline.json and mel_filters.bin:
  from https://huggingface.co/mlboydaisuke/EmbeddingGemma-2-Transcribe-CoreAI at revision
  76865ae46793e05617c2a7420454b0c7eb8541a4, Apache License 2.0. pipeline.json was adapted to the
  Mandarin reader (PROVENANCE.txt in the model folder); the licence files are in the model folder's
  licenses/EmbeddingGemma-2-Transcribe-CoreAI/. Use of EmbeddingGemma 2 must follow the Gemma
  Prohibited Use Policy (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).
